Description:

New jmap_base_url option to advertise absolute URLs in the JMAP Session
object, for clients that cannot resolve relative URLs.


Documentation:

lib/imapoptions/jmap_base_url


Config changes:

jmap_base_url


Upgrade instructions:

None.  If unset, the Session object advertises relative URLs, as before.


GitHub issue:

https://github.com/cyrusimap/cyrus-docker-test-server/issues/6
